398
00:47:01.490 --> 00:47:07.869
Sophie Bulloch: That's it. So, quite often, it's just not sufficiently enough documentation for the good first issue.

399
00:47:08.080 --> 00:47:12.640
Sophie Bulloch: That's why, retroactively, I actually have not had much success.

