00:47:12.750 --> 00:47:14.859
Sophie Bulloch: If I close down an issue.

401
00:47:15.340 --> 00:47:30.500
Sophie Bulloch: sorry, if I have an issue that hasn't been successful, I will typically close it, and if I really do believe it's a good first issue, I will create it again using the template, because, we don't really have good insights into what makes

