00:47:30.680 --> 00:47:32.439
Sophie Bulloch: good first issues.

403
00:47:32.910 --> 00:47:47.310
Sophie Bulloch: like, stall or fail. It could be a variety of different issues, and, you know, we can talk to the people, but we can just talk to one developer at a time. We don't know… we don't know, really, the whole story, so we just want to make it as easy as possible.

404
00:47:48.780 --> 00:47:58.240
Sophie Bulloch: So that everybody's able to contribute in a fair way. So if an issue is closed, I will open it in a more specialized way.

