407
00:48:09.890 --> 00:48:20.720
Matthew Whitehead (Kaleido): Okay, yeah, thanks. I guess… I guess what I struggle with are a couple of things here. It's not… not the approach itself, it's just the whole concept around goods versus issues, is sometimes…

408
00:48:20.960 --> 00:48:40.400
