409
00:48:41.920 --> 00:48:57.759
Matthew Whitehead (Kaleido): the solution of a good first issue sometimes comes out in the wash. You don't really know when you're writing the… it as a good first issue. You're kind of sizing the piece of work and the area that you think is good for someone to contribute in as a first comer.

410
00:48:57.760 --> 00:49:02.420
Matthew Whitehead (Kaleido): But actually, the solution of how you solve it comes through the implementation.

411
00:49:02.430 --> 00:49:20.769
Matthew Whitehead (Kaleido): so that you cannot put that much detail into the issue, already knowing how someone's going to implement it. And I think that's… that's something that I always look at, because when I want committers into the project that eventually want to be maintainers, I want to think about how are they solving the problem? How are they thinking about the coach race? How are they…

412
00:49:20.780 --> 00:49:30.600
